            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 146700,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Por qué es la autoasignación un concepto de programación tan poderoso en los juegos?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Porque nos permite rastrear datos del juego que cambian con el tiempo</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Porque es necesario crear colisiones</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Porque es necesario para dibujar sprites</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Porque nos permite rastrear datos del juego que cambian con el tiempo.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 146701,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Resta uno del valor de la variable <code>playerLives</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"120\" /><option startIndex=\"121\" endIndex=\"122\" /><option startIndex=\"123\" endIndex=\"124\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerLives = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerLives = playerLives - \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Lives left: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + playerLives);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerLives = playerLives - \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Lives left: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + playerLives);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game over!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>playerLives</code> seguido de <code>-</code> y finalmente <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 146702,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué muestra este código en la consola?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bossSpawned = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"bossSpawned = bossSpawned;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(bossSpawned);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"bossSpawned\"</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>bossSpawned</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 146703,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué muestra este código en la consola?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"score = score + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>01</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 146704,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué muestra este código en la consola?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = \" /><text value=\"&quot;sword shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"inventory = inventory + \" /><text value=\"&quot; potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inventory);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>sword shield potion</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>potion sword shield</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>inventory potion</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>sword shield potion</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
